<section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-16"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367703/eurocert/pp.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20 scale-105" alt="Good Hygiene Practices"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/70 via-transparent to-[#f0f5fa]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10 text-center"><div class="inline-block glass-panel px-6 py-2 rounded-full mb-8 border-accent/30"><span class="text-[9px] font-tech font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-[0.5em]">Fundamental hygiene standards for safe food production</span></div><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-black text-gray-800 tracking-wide mb-4 leading-none uppercase hero-text-shadow">Good Hygiene <br/><span class="text-accent">Practices (GHP)</span></h1><p class="text-sm md:text-xl text-gray-500 font-tech font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Foundation for Food Safety Systems</p></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative z-10"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="space-y-10"><div class="space-y-4"><span class="text-accent font-tech font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-xs">Standard Overview</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-black text-gray-800 leading-tight uppercase tracking-tighter">Good Hygiene <br/><span class="text-accent">Practices (GHP)</span></h2></div><p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed font-sans max-w-xl">Good Hygiene Practices (GHP) certification ensures that food businesses follow fundamental hygiene principles necessary for producing safe food. GHP forms the foundation upon which other food safety systems like HACCP and ISO 22000 are built.</p><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] border-l-4 border-accent"><h4 class="text-gray-800 font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-lg mb-4">What are Good Hygiene Practices?</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Good Hygiene Practices (GHP) are a set of basic conditions and activities necessary to maintain a hygienic environment throughout the food chain. They cover all aspects of food production, from raw material handling to finished product distribution. GHP is based on Codex Alimentarius guidelines and is a prerequisite program for all food safety management systems.</p></div></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-gray-200 h-[400px] sm:h-[500px]"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367703/eurocert/pp.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" alt="Good Hygiene Practices"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative z-10 bg-navy-light/20 border-y border-gray-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16 md:mb-24"><h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-black text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-widest leading-none">Key <span class="text-accent">Requirements</span></h2><p class="text-gray-500 mt-6 font-tech uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Comprehensive Hygiene Assessment Areas</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] group hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-accent hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(91,141,239,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-400"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-accent/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 uppercase">Personal Hygiene Assessment</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">Evaluation of personal hygiene practices of food handlers including handwashing, protective clothing, and illness reporting procedures.</p></div><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] group hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-accent hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(91,141,239,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-400"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-accent/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 uppercase">Cleaning &amp; Sanitation Verification</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">Comprehensive review of cleaning and sanitation procedures, schedules, and verification methods to ensure hygienic food production environments.</p></div><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] group hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-accent hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(91,141,239,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-400"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-accent/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 uppercase">Facility Design &amp; Maintenance</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">Assessment of facility layout, design, and maintenance practices to ensure they support hygienic food production and prevent contamination.</p></div><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] group hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-accent hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(91,141,239,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-400"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-accent/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20.618 5.984A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 uppercase">Water Quality &amp; Pest Control</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">Verification of water quality management, supply systems, waste management protocols, and integrated pest control measures.</p></div><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] group hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-accent hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(91,141,239,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-400"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-accent/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 uppercase">Temperature &amp; Cold Chain Control</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">Assessment of temperature control systems and cold chain management to ensure food safety throughout storage and distribution.</p></div><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] group hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-accent hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(91,141,239,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-400"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-accent/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 uppercase">Training &amp; Cross-Contamination Prevention</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">Staff training and awareness programs along with cross-contamination prevention measures for raw material handling and storage.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative z-10"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20"><div class="space-y-12"><h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-black text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-widest border-l-4 border-accent pl-6">Benefits of GHP Certification</h3><div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex gap-6 group"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(0,123,167,0.5)] flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-wide">Food Safety Foundation</h5><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Establish the basics for a robust food safety system upon which HACCP and ISO 22000 are built.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-6 group"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(0,123,167,0.5)] flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-wide">Regulatory Compliance</h5><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Meet local and international hygiene regulations based on Codex Alimentarius guidelines.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-6 group"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(0,123,167,0.5)] flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-wide">Consumer Protection</h5><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Reduce risk of foodborne illness and protect consumers through verified hygiene standards.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-6 group"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(0,123,167,0.5)] flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-wide">Prerequisite for HACCP</h5><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Build the essential foundation for advanced food safety certifications like HACCP and ISO 22000.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-6 group"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(0,123,167,0.5)] flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-wide">Staff Awareness</h5><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Improve hygiene culture across the organization with trained and aware personnel.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-6 group"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(0,123,167,0.5)] flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-wide">Market Confidence</h5><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Demonstrate commitment to food safety standards and build confidence with buyers and partners.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-panel p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-[3rem] border border-accent/20 flex flex-col justify-center text-center sm:text-left"><h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-black text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 leading-tight">Why <br class="hidden sm:block"/>Eurocert Asia?</h3><p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed font-sans mb-10">Eurocert Asia provides thorough GHP assessments and certification services. Our food safety experts help organizations implement effective hygiene practices and achieve certification, paving the way for more advanced food safety standards like HACCP and ISO 22000.</p><div class="space-y-4"><div class="bg-primary/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100"><span class="text-accent font-black text-4xl block mb-2 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Years of Industrial Intelligence</span></div><div class="bg-primary/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100"><span class="text-accent font-black text-4xl block mb-2 leading-none">100%</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Certification Success Rate</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative z-10 border-t border-gray-100 bg-navy-light/40"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 mb-16 text-center lg:text-left"><h2 class="text-4xl font-display font-black text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-widest">Related <span class="text-accent">Services</span></h2></div><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><a class="group relative h-[380px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 glass-panel" href="/food-certification/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367664/eurocert/F3.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white via-white/70 to-transparent z-10"></div><div class="absolute bottom-8 left-6 right-6 z-20"><h4 class="text-gray-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">HACCP</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase text-accent group-hover:text-white transition tracking-[0.2em]">Hazard Analysis</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[380px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 glass-panel" href="/food-certification/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367673/eurocert/F5.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white via-white/70 to-transparent z-10"></div><div cla